{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 源动画曲线｜CMC move流程与Editor边界\n主线为原PerformMovement/重演：CMC唯一时钟与胶囊执行，源曲线在显式区间求值。\n[[Animation/曲线处理|算法与证据]] · [[GGYGO_结构_动画曲线.canvas|结构图]] · [[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画表现.canvas|表现流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 5240,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 0｜装配/切换数值配置\nCMC.SetMovementSet→ValidateMovementSet。\n明确Fixed/曲线模式与数值合法才接受，非法清旧接受状态。\n曲线模式不要求七Profile；默认Set七废弃引用null、十九参数保持。\n源配置另由Animation公开publication进入，不在每步重装配。\n无缺配置→固定业务速度替代。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1｜UE执行一次move\nUE/服务器move或客户端重演 → PerformMovement(dt)。\n先快照 bHasRootMotionSources=HasRootMotionSources()，按该门禁清理无效Source，再应用累积力。\n\n随后调用UpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement(dt)。Native其余前置略去；TickComponent没有SampleAnimCurves。\n快照早于Before中的RMS安装；不能仅凭“已安装”宣称本move必定Prepare。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3｜栈内候选选择\nBefore → TryUpdateLocomotion；捕获原执行号，CaptureLocomotionCandidate借用16既有字段。\n候选ResolveGait／混合／段选择保持Start／Stop／TurnBack拓扑。\nIsCurrentMotionFinished(candidate,out,error)：缺／非法依赖失败，不算完成。\n离地／被阻止提交合法None；无持久第二状态机。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4｜按原段选择执行\nGetLocomotionSourceBinding重验原身份/状态。\n普通单段→源EvaluateSingleInterval；WalkRun→实际BS重载。\nStop/TurnBack→Stage原binding/Input/Origin，等待实际Prepare。\nCompleted只普通求剩余clip，不重新挂物理资源。\n普通受理dt维持既有限制；失效依赖不当完成。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "guard",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2｜Before分支\n先CleanupFinishedActionMotion；独立合法动作／原生RootMotion优先，走原权限路径。\n原RMS回放上下文有效／已拒绝且无独立动作：一次Consume匹配Prepared或Reset；不重做普通整帧求值，仍调用Super。\n无已接受配置、来源失败／无执行请求→地面准入；非回放、非Proxy才进普通候选。\nProxy沿复制语义路径。回放边只表示Before后顺序，其它Prepare仍按原生门禁。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "diff",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5｜源Sequence纯区间求值\n内部SampleInterval→EvaluateCurveData。\n单段源秒=move秒×SequenceRateScale；loop用共相位×源长。\n非循环clamp；Yaw按明确周期解绕，端点Speed/Dir转换实际time rate。\n有限非零Dir先缩放再归一；单源正速须方向。\n失败Reset/Error，无Graph/clock/Pos差分。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "motion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 7｜普通成功才Commit\n写原段/time/cycle/alpha/sequence/turn与CurveMotion。\n纯求值不写clock；候选不是独立准入。\n原RMS实际区间在Prepare→Consume一次提交。\n有PendingInput不再走普通源更新；失败不推进。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 2760,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "consume",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 11｜原生进入物理\nPerformMovement：早期速度处理 → UpdateVelocityBeforeMovement(dt) → StartNewPhysics(dt,0)。\n按MovementMode分派PhysWalking/NavWalking等；内部可子步/切换模式。\n\n普通和AnimRM/Override路径在各物理步判定，不是“所有Profile都走RMS”。当前样本由本次Before产生；子步沿用，不另造时钟。\n物理返回且HasValidData才继续AfterMovement。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 14｜原生条件旋转，再完成move\nAfterMovement之后，若AllowPhysicsRotationDuringAnimRootMotion或无AnimRM → PhysicsRotation(dt)。\n\nGGYGO先处理活动/注册Action及地面准入；非Proxy转身阶段取YawDeltaDegrees，当前非有限值置0；非近零时MoveUpdatedComponent(ZeroVector,NewRotation,true)扫掠转角，该分支返回，其它交Super。\n条件不满足则跳过该回调。\n\n其后还有原生RootMotion旋转/OnMovementUpdated等尾部，完成move；客户端PostUpdate记录输出语义hint。不是源曲线再次求值。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 5090,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "predict",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 客户端原move与权威replay\nSetMoveFor保存原binding/基线；PostUpdate存原Input/Prepared/Pending。\nPrepMoveFor先安装原binding/组，再native Super。\n普通保留原区间；authority清旧派生Prepared，用原合法binding/native interval沿权威基线重算。\n缺原区间不造整帧；FAILED不重开，退休binding不授后继。\nClear/EndReplay清引用；导入Origin/网络未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "action",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Action分支｜跳过Locomotion\nHasActiveActionMotion为true：CurveMotion.Reset → Super Before → 返回原生PerformMovement余下流程。\n\n已有Action/其资源仍由既有Action/GAS/CMC/原生链处理；本图不展开或重建Action生命周期，不替换为Locomotion Profile。\n[[Movement/结构|Action执行接口]]",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "admission",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 准入拒绝｜不补号或业务兜底\n清CurveMotion及自有Brake／TurnBack源；独立合法RootMotion保留。\n无接受配置、来源失败／无执行请求，Enforce地面准入；待原生Montage提取时在物理最终核对。\n清重力平面速度、一次诊断；不借零Acceleration认真实释放。\nSuper Before返回，不选择默认Walk／Run。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "proxy",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Proxy代码分支｜主入口之外\n回调中跳过ResolveGait/UpdateLocomotion/UpdateCurveBrake；UpdateTurnBackRootMotion自身对SimulatedProxy返回，然后Super Before。\n\n代理复制语义及原生Simulate/RootMotion入口有各自路径。本图不把权威PerformMovement顺序当作proxy实际运行证明；不展开其物理路径，也不新增本地Profile时钟。\nProxy/网络动态未验。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 2760,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "walkrun",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4B｜实际BS样本与共相位\nGetSamplesFromBlendInput(alpha)得原样本/权重。\nGetAnimationLengthFromSampleData得native P，不手写时长Lerp。\ncycle1=cycle0+acceptedDt/P；源秒=cycle×Li，速率=Li/P。\n逐源速度向量后混合；不是Player filtered cache/Marker时钟。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "single_result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6A｜单段返回\n成功：候选样本／段末时间；TurnBack求值成功才推进候选相位。\n失败：原Error→Reject原请求；不提交候选时钟／状态。\n缺曲线依赖不当完成或fixed；显式fixed分开。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "walk_result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6B｜源混合返回\nV=sum(wi*Vi)，Speed=|V|，Dir从V求出；Yaw区间独立加权。\n合法mixed zero保留成功，不作资源退出。\n依赖/非有限/缩放失败整体Reset/Error，不替代资源。\n数学末相位只在CMC成功Commit后回绕。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "rms_gate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 8｜Stage或普通Before尾部\n原Stop／TurnBack Stage已暂存Input并挂原Source；有PendingInput时不再走普通Brake／TurnBack源更新，等待实际Prepare。\n同Completed Origin仅普通求值／Commit剩余clip，不重挂原物理执行。\n无PendingInput：UpdateCurveBrake→Hint，随后UpdateTurnBackRootMotion→Super Before返回；Proxy按原路径返回。\nApply只复用同原Origin的活动自有源，固定BaseYaw／Scale／结束策略。安装不保证当帧Prepare。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 2760,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 450,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "native_prepare",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 9｜原生实际Prepare区间\n早期Source门禁允许时PrepareRootMotion(actual sim,tick)。\n原Source携Origin/binding请求CMC.Prepare；CMC重验原Input/身份并调用纯源单段。\n普通一次Consume；authority沿原native interval重算派生结果，Before消费。\nRMS写返回世界速度/native EndTime；端点速度×sim/tick，非平移积分。\nStop真零速/离地按自然生命周期结束；TurnBack按phase，mixed zero不结束其它资源。\n挂载不保证准备，跳过不补区间。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "early_accumulate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 10｜原生早期速度累积\nPrepare阶段之后、StartNewPhysics之前：\nHasAnimRootMotion优先 → 转世界/计算约束动画根速度。\n否则HasOverrideVelocity且dt>0 → AccumulateOverrideRootMotionVelocity(...NewVelocity) → Velocity。\n两者都无则保留当前普通速度继续。\n\n这一次早期累积不能移到物理或After之后；物理中还会按步应用RootMotion。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 12A｜普通原生速度\nPhysWalking无AnimRM／Override时CalcVelocity查询GetMaxSpeed。\n曲线合法来源取真实Speed×Scale（含0／极小正）；ForceWalk限上界。\n显式fixed取配置；曲线失败／无来源地面门禁0、不回落固定。\n继续ApplyRootMotionToVelocity与胶囊物理；非地面交原生。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 4310,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "override_physics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 12B｜AnimRM/Override物理\nPhysWalking该步跳过普通CalcVelocity，调用ApplyRootMotionToVelocity(timeTick)。\n项目先检查地面准入，合法路径交Super；原生AnimRM优先，否则累积Override/可能Additive，应用胶囊物理。\n\nRootMotion速度不因源数据提交必然存在；RMS内部安全不由GetMaxSpeed资格校验自动保证。Source退出帧及重力/Z规则保留。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 4310,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "after_move",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 13｜物理返回后回调\nStartNewPhysics完整返回，仍HasValidData → UpdateCharacterStateAfterMovement(dt)。\n\n随后才进入原生PhysicsRotation条件。不得把项目转身Yaw画到Before/Prepare之前；无RMS普通物理也走此返回顺序。\n其它原生碰撞/模式/回调前后置未重建。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 4310,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 独立Animation更新\nBase原生命周期发布/撤原source配置，再StateCapture抓当时CMC/ASC/Pawn语义。\nFrame给ABP，CurveMotion入Debug；没有Player时间接线。\n表现更新不是此move固定执行顺序；不反读当前Graph曲线。\nABP/物理clock本批不承诺一致。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2760,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 已验证与剩余边界\nGate91编译exit0，四烟3Success/1Fail；FailedRequestRecovery仍有原两配置Error与请求3恢复标记。\n三DirX精确修正/fresh冷读；七旧DA已解绑删除并冷读Registry/Set。\nFullBody已有Gate82保存；Player/Evaluator相位未迁。\n真实Run/Stop、DS/网络/首帧/partial/catchup/后继隔离/PlayerCombo位移未验。\nraw骨键/Channel未验。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#6. 当前失败消费缺口与实施状态|实际证据]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "candidate-rejected",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## false｜原请求失败／旧源退场\n普通false：Reject原执行号，非零失败／0号不补；不提交候选，Super Before返回。\n原Prepare失败：只报告仍匹配原Origin的请求；Stale／Unsupported只退自身，不影响后继。\n旧结果不恢复FAILED，不取固定速度／默认方向成功；独立动作、重力及原生后续物理／清理保留。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4310,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-explicit-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Editor 1｜源动画唯一编辑\nSpeed/DirX/DirY/Yaw留在源Sequence；生成器保留有限非零量/float32写入校验。\n公开ReadFloatCurveSnapshot交完整同步值供审查，无运行handle/clock。\n不创建独立运行曲线DA。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#7. 历史Sampler与Editor读回边界|读取与生成边界]]",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 580,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-author-call",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Editor 2｜定向源修正\n仅Run_End83/99、Walk_End151现有DirX.Key.Value 0→1。\n原包备份/保护字段核对→定向修改→精确单包保存。\n首次保存前身份读回失败原日志保留；后继成功不改判历史。\n无整曲线bake覆盖；raw骨键/Channel未验。",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 670,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-result-handoff",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Editor 3｜fresh冷读\n三值精确保存后新进程cold read exit0，其它已约定字段保持。\n这证明定向值修正，未证明raw骨键/Channel/生产Stop或Run。\n运行binding只引用源，CMC按move区间读曲线；Editor值副本不接每move执行。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#6. 当前失败消费缺口与实施状态|证据范围]]",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 660,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "binding-publication",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 来源配置关联（原Native生命周期，非每move调用）\nZZZ解析五single route＋实际BS样本→Base调用Publish(binding,error)。保存原Producer/Character/Mesh/代次与Status/Error；Missing/Invalid只在必需曲线消费时拒绝。\nUninitialize/Owner/config退出调用Retire(originalProducer,originalConfigGeneration)，只撤原publication。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-profile-history",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 历史Profile作者（非生产支线）\nCreateOrInspectProfile/整RichCurve复制/CreatedUnsaved由调用者保存等工具保留历史。\n旧Sampler/Profile纯重载不进入CMC生产；七2026-10-04产物已退役。\n旧失败与报告保留，不恢复副本兜底。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#8. Editor单Profile作者与保存边界|历史工具]]",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 3480,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile-retire",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 七旧DA退役（已执行）\n八包备份→默认Set七引用null/十九参数bit保持→Registry incoming空。\nCLI正常退出后统筹离线删除七uasset。\nActionMotionProfile归独立动作链。\n准备报告prepared_for_offline_deletion，exit0。",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 4310,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile-retire-cold",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## fresh Registry / Set验退役\n新CLI exit0、completed：七目标资产/依赖节点不存在。\ncold Set七引用null/十九参数/源包/备份保持，dirty=[]。\n不证明真实Run/网络/完整骨轨。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#8. Editor单Profile作者与保存边界|范围与证据]]",
      "x": 4280,
      "y": 5090,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "asset",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "guard",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "状态输入：已接纳配置/明确模式\n不是每步重做SetMovementSet",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "tick",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "guard",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "执行：UpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement(dt)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "read",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "source",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "候选运动类型／未提交时间"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "walkrun",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Type=WalkRun → EvaluateWalkRunSource → EvaluateWalkRunInterval"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "diff",
      "toSide": "right",
